        "id": "v2-openai-chat-completions",
        "title": "OpenAI API: Chat completions",
        "url": "https://platform.openai.com/docs/api-reference/chat",
        "verified_on": "2026-08-17"
      },
      {
        "id": "anthropic-messages-api-t28",
        "title": "Anthropic API: Create a Message",
        "url": "https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/api/messages/create",
        "verified_on": "2026-08-13"
      }
    ],
    "notes": [
      "字段名与结构逐段对照官方文档；数值（id、token 数、耗时、时间戳、回复正文）为课程构造的真实感取值，不是某次真实调用的记录。",
      "在维护者完成现场采集并替换本文件之前，页面必须以「已记录样例（构造，非此刻发出）」口径展示，不得声称数值来自现场实调。",
      "样例不含任何密钥、账号或个人信息；authorization/x-api-key 等敏感头只以占位说明出现。",
      "2026-08-17 构造当天对两个文档 URL 的在线复核尝试失败（403 / 连接超时），形状依据沿用仓库来源账本既有核验记录。",
      "2026-08-18：维护者以自有密钥完成一次 W3 真实调用现场抽查（浏览器直连 BYO-key），确认匿名调用摘要落盘与真实数字回放回填路径；本文件数值仍为构造值，待现场采集数字替换。"
    ]
  },
  "samples": {
    "openai": {
      "providerId": "openai",
      "providerLabel": "OpenAI",
      "endpoint": "https://api.openai.com/v1/chat/completions",
      "method": "POST",
      "model": "gpt-4o-mini",
      "request": {
        "body": {
          "model": "gpt-4o-mini",
          "max_tokens": 500,
          "messages": [
            {
              "role": "system",
              "content": "你是中文课程《Agent 工程入门》的教学助手。用不超过 120 字的简体中文回答学员问题。"
            },
            {
              "role": "user",
              "content": "用一句话解释：模型和 Agent 有什么区别？"
            }
          ]
        },
        "headers_note": [
          "content-type: application/json",
          "authorization: Bearer <你的密钥>（样例不含密钥）"
        ]
      },
      "response": {
        "id": "chatcmpl-sample-4f9a2b",
        "object": "chat.completion",
        "created": 1755379200,
        "model": "gpt-4o-mini-2024-07-18",
        "choices": [
          {
            "index": 0,
            "message": {
              "role": "assistant",
              "content": "模型负责从输入生成文字，一次调用就结束；Agent 则把模型包进一个循环：围绕目标调用工具、观察结果、决定下一步，直到任务完成。"
            },
            "logprobs": null,
            "finish_reason": "stop"
          }
        ],
        "usage": {
          "prompt_tokens": 52,
          "completion_tokens": 64,
          "total_tokens": 116
        },
        "system_fingerprint": "fp_sample_44709d"
      },
      "usage": {
        "inputTokens": 52,
        "outputTokens": 64
      },
      "elapsedMs": 1240,
      "annotations": [
        {
          "pointer": "id / object",
          "note": "服务商为这次调用生成的唯一编号与对象类型（chat.completion）；排查问题时报编号最有效。"
        },
        {
          "pointer": "model",
          "note": "实际使用的模型版本；可能与请求名不同（常带日期后缀）。"
        },
        {
          "pointer": "choices[0].message.content",
          "note": "模型回复正文——实验页展示的就是这一段。"
        },
        {
          "pointer": "choices[0].finish_reason",
          "note": "stop 表示模型自己认为说完了，不是被 max_tokens 截断。"
        },
        {
          "pointer": "usage.prompt_tokens",
          "note": "你发来的内容折算的输入 token 数；系统指令同样计入。"
        },
        {
          "pointer": "usage.completion_tokens",
          "note": "模型生成内容的输出 token 数；计费看输入与输出两部分。"
        },
        {
          "pointer": "usage.total_tokens",
          "note": "输入 + 输出的合计，方便快速核对。"
        },
        {
          "pointer": "system_fingerprint",
          "note": "服务商标识后端配置的指纹，属内部追踪信息，实验中不需要处理。"
        }
      ]
    },
    "anthropic": {
      "providerId": "anthropic",
      "providerLabel": "Anthropic",
      "endpoint": "https://api.anthropic.com/v1/messages",
      "method": "POST",
      "model": "claude-3-5-haiku-latest",
      "request": {
        "body": {
          "model": "claude-3-5-haiku-latest",
          "max_tokens": 500,
          "system": "你是中文课程《Agent 工程入门》的教学助手。用不超过 120 字的简体中文回答学员问题。",
          "messages": [
            {
              "role": "user",
              "content": "用一句话解释：模型和 Agent 有什么区别？"
            }
          ]
        },
        "headers_note": [
          "content-type: application/json",
          "x-api-key: <你的密钥>（样例不含密钥）",
          "anthropic-version: 2023-06-01",
          "anthropic-dangerous-direct-browser-access: true（浏览器直连许可头）"
        ]
      },
      "response": {
        "id": "msg_sample_01X7Qk2b",
        "type": "message",
        "role": "assistant",
        "model": "claude-3-5-haiku-20241022",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "模型负责从输入生成文字，一次调用就结束；Agent 则把模型包进一个循环：围绕目标调用工具、观察结果、决定下一步，直到任务完成。"
          }
        ],
        "stop_reason": "end_turn",
        "stop_sequence": null,
        "usage": {
          "input_tokens": 58,
          "output_tokens": 61
        }
      },
      "usage": {
        "inputTokens": 58,
        "outputTokens": 61
      },
      "elapsedMs": 980,
      "annotations": [
        {
          "pointer": "id / type / role",
          "note": "消息唯一编号（msg_ 前缀）、对象类型 message 与回复角色 assistant。"
        },
        {
          "pointer": "model",
          "note": "实际处理请求的模型版本。"
        },
        {
          "pointer": "content[]",
          "note": "内容块数组；纯文本回复是一个 { type: \"text\" } 块，正文在 text 字段。"
        },
        {
          "pointer": "stop_reason",
          "note": "end_turn 表示模型自然说完（对应 OpenAI 的 finish_reason: stop）。"
        },
        {
          "pointer": "usage.input_tokens / output_tokens",
          "note": "输入与输出 token 各一个字段；Anthropic 不额外给 total，合计由调用方自己算。"
        }
      ]
    }
  }
}
